===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[Fallopian]] [[tube]]}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=en}} Either of the two ducts in female [[mammal]]s through which [[ova]] pass from the [[ovary|ovaries]] to the [[uterus]].

